* Std. Error
var_ict = MS_Error*{1/n + (xb_1^2*S22 + xb_2^2*S11 - 2*xb_1*xb_2*(S12))/(S11*S22 - (S12)^2)} = 5.03322202270973
SE_ict = Sqrt(var_ict) = 2.24348434866609
var_slp_1 = MS_Error*S22/(S11*S22 - (S12)^2) = 1.30427856495057E-05
SE_slp_1 = Sqrt(var_slp_1) = 0.00361147970359875
